<title>USA: IES Industries Inc Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>IES Industries Inc Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.70		    $1.06</p>
<p> Net		 20,889		   31,120</p>
<p> Oper revs	 233,907		  238,467</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   29,941		   29,314</p>
<p>NOTE: IES estimated that costs related to its successful defense of the hostile takeover attempt by MidAmerican Energy Co reduced 1996 third quarter earnings by $0.15 a share.</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
